<title>USA: Lattice names Laub COO, Skaggs CFO.</title>
<headline>Lattice names Laub COO, Skaggs CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HILLSBORO, Ore. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lattice Semiconductor Corp said Steven Laub was promoted to senior vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He joined Lattice in 1990 as vice president and general manager.</p>
<p>Lattice also named Stephen Skaggs as senior vice president, chief financial officer. Skaggs joined Lattice in 1992 as director, corporate development.</p>
<p>Officials were not immediately available to disclose who Laub and Skaggs were replacing.</p>
